msgstr "舵机/电机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:84
#: 6686d2e9c35841048f942f642b3f9bff
msgid ""
"The BLITZ Whoop F7 AIO has 4 PWM outputs internally connected to its 4-in-1 "
"ESC. The pads for motor output are M1 to M4 on the board. All 4 outputs "
"support bi-directional DShot and DShot, as well as all PWM types. The "
"default configuration is for bi-directional DShot using the already "
"installed BlueJay firmware."
msgstr ""
"BLITZ Whoop F7 AIO 内部有 4 路 PWM 输出连接到 4in1 ESC。电机输出焊盘为板上的 M1 至 M4。所有 4 "
"路输出支持双向 DShot 和 DShot，以及所有 PWM 类型。默认配置为使用已安装的 BlueJay 固件的双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:86
#: 56601dd3bafa4a6c95e40bf2d5c07005
msgid "The PWM are in in two groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为两组："

