#: 3fab8fab052c4f0298d405a43fde2542
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:89
#: a62f107ad1bc4a0eb6d856ac56cf86b2
msgid "PWM 5 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:91
#: ed32e46666564468bef0e2e39e369dce
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从 BetaflightX 四轴迁移的用户，前四路输出 M1-M4 已使用以下默认参数配置为适配现有电机接线："

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:93
#: 6436b47ac9614650b7e145926a92395d
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四轴）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:94
#: bfe9fe49edac4fb4b01d79594931be47
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:98
#: c8b630b277434c0387a7625ede2df506
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:100
#: 5eafcc78735444eaa9fd740231deb6e8
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default on RX2 on the DJI connector and supports "
"all single wire RC protocols (SBUS,DSM,etc.) except PPM. FPort, when "
"connected in this manner, can provide RC but without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认通过 DJI 连接器上的 RX2 配置，支持所有单线 RC 协议（SBUS、DSM 等），PPM 除外。以此方式连接时，FPort 可提供"
" RC 信号但无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:102
#: 7687c5b0be21408faaba60755e0edbd8
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2  require a full UART connection. You should use one with"
" DMA for CRSF/ELRS. For example you could retask UART4 for GPS by setting "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = \"5\" (GPS), then use UART3 for "
"RC input and set :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` = \"23\". Under "
"this scenario:"
msgstr ""
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 需要完整的 UART 连接。CRSF/ELRS 应使用支持 DMA 的 UART。例如，可将 UART4 改为用于 "
"GPS，设置 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 「5」（GPS），然后将 UART3 用于 RC "
"输入并设置 :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` = 「23」。在此场景下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:104
#: 6af40ab2f9a2421d910ccff520d3e7d2
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX3 connection, in addition to RX3, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX3 外还需要 TX3 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:106
#: 56b699fe71a64593af894b79ea4b60e4
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX3 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 TX3 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:108
#: 9c71e255a32c41879c29fbaf15edafac
msgid ""
"FPORT with telemetry could use this setup also, but connects only to TX3 and"
" :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` would be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""
"带数传的 FPort 也可使用此设置，但只连接到 TX3，:ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:111
#: 9a0e94a836b5458f915aa1234d61b914
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:113
#: 764d8ad14d1b4124a5dc737f7d8f98d1
msgid ""
"The Blitz Whoop F7 AIO supports analog video transmission using its internal"
" OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). External OSD support such as DJI or "
"DisplayPort is supported by default on USART1 RX/TX or any other free UART. "
"See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"Blitz Whoop F7 AIO 支持通过内置 OSD 使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）进行模拟视频传输。外部 OSD 支持（如 "
"DJI 或 DisplayPort）默认在 USART1 RX/TX 或任何其他空闲 UART 上支持。详见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

