#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:131
#: dec8060313074544b75e09d718c711f2
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:133
#: 76274c9e4ae54194863baac56441c036
msgid ""
"This board does not include a Compass and/or GPS so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` can be connected in order for"
" autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"本板不含罗盘和/或 GPS，可连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"以使自主模式正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:136
#: d2d8b43202ed469ebb5f79480d726e9d
msgid "NeoPixel LED"
msgstr "NeoPixel LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:138
#: c9e5584e3d8645b49a4d0e862506d2ae
msgid ""
"The board includes a NeoPixel LED on the underside which is pre-configured "
"to output ArduPilot sequences. This is the fifth PWM output. Its connection "
"is also available by the LED pad."
msgstr ""
"本板底部有一个 NeoPixel LED，已预配置为输出 ArduPilot 序列。这是第 5 路 PWM 输出，其连接也可通过 LED 焊盘获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:141
#: f94f6168b93b4a6dac05fc15a661d2f4
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 加载到板上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:143
#: 5ecd70a1bfbd427fbce6324dfedc32e8
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the boot "
"button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, see "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可通过 DFU 完成，即按住 boot 按钮同时插入 USB。然后加载「with_bl.hex」固件，参见 :ref:`common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:147
#: 250b2c9e8b9f42eb8be6171364396757
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software, see :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"pixhawk`."
msgstr ""
"初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件，参见 :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"pixhawk`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:151
