#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-blitzf7AIO.rst:153
#: cb13480846354355993e196aba650cdd
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"BlitzF745AIO\" "
"n."
msgstr ""
"本板固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标记为「BlitzF745AIO」的子文件夹中。"
